{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10104","headline":"江上曲 · 李嘉佑","name":"江上曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江心澹澹芙蓉花，江口蛾眉独浣纱。\n可怜应是阳台女，对坐鹭鸶娇不语。\n掩面羞看北地人，回身忽作空山语。\n苍梧秋色不堪论，千载依依帝子魂。\n君看峰上斑斑竹，尽是湘妃泣泪痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}